  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "To get to the settings menu, for example to change avatar audio volume, you must either go to the audio tab then main menu OR go to the settings tab then main menu.\nThis is technically just a difference of one extra click versus the old quick menu, but making the settings menu more accessible seems more important than having an additional menu for emojis, which already exist in the radial menu. (iirc the emoji menu in the quick menu was going to be removed with this UI update)",
